{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UnLoop</strong> is a retro-futuristic VR puzzle game built around self-cooperative time loop mechanics. As a spy infiltrating a remote space station, you encounter a temporal phenomenon that creates copies of yourself each loop, replaying your past actions in real time. Learning to work with your past selves and use the loop to your advantage becomes the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: solve puzzles, retrieve critical data from the station, and uncover the source of the time loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/59f540a770c8a4bc76bd99e41722920a.poster.avif?t=1763046229\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/59f540a770c8a4bc76bd99e41722920a.webm?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/59f540a770c8a4bc76bd99e41722920a.mp4?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d2466474e0a8263b23cc4f35161fe9d3.poster.avif?t=1763046229\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d2466474e0a8263b23cc4f35161fe9d3.webm?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d2466474e0a8263b23cc4f35161fe9d3.mp4?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38Solve mind-bending temporal puzzles by mastering self-cooperation. Your copies repeat previous actions in real time, so planning ahead and synchronising with your past selves is key. The loop adds a fourth dimension to puzzle solving as you learn to think with time as well as space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/455c6e497374a7efa018f813a876ebd3.poster.avif?t=1763046229\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/455c6e497374a7efa018f813a876ebd3.webm?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/455c6e497374a7efa018f813a876ebd3.mp4?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38Harness the power of VR to physically interact with the world and your copies. Get ready to dodge lasers, throw objects, even record voice notes for your future self; and when you mess up, UnLoop and rewrite the timeline. New mechanics are regularly introduced and combined in unexpected ways to keep you thinking on your feet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.poster.avif?t=1763046229\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.webm?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.mp4?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38Explore the Temporal Research Hub, an atompunk space station with a slick spy-movie atmosphere, and untangle its secrets. Progress through various sectors of the station, such as the Asset Assembly factory and the mysterious Nexus Frame, and puzzle together a story that continues with each new update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Station Infiltration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/e4e8b6702c0d6a7146165b3c197ac8cf6a8c6758.jpg"},{"name":"Freight Repository","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/25085d8c6bd76a676f9227ce26972c33b926cc68.jpg"},{"name":"Are You Okay?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/b96bd8b41e0a392e283b69dc89bdbeec919d9b61.jpg"},{"name":"Cheeky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/ec089fa4082087684a0d2c189689fb59dcf98910.jpg"},{"name":"Six Shooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/3963888716564f5a11a19b03ab2d95d17f1103bb.jpg"},{"name":"Quit While You\u2019re Ahead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/3963888716564f5a11a19b03ab2d95d17f1103bb.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/d6ffb22ad94a616747f0f61756508c6581e97e7e.jpg"},{"name":"Double Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/3963888716564f5a11a19b03ab2d95d17f1103bb.jpg"},{"name":"You\u2019ve Been Framed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/a589df5748ca9513b843d21361a936f1372cf864.jpg"},{"name":"Self-Loathing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672470/3963888716564f5a11a19b03ab2d95d17f1103bb.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2672470?t=1763046229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763046229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/e688c200b957cca42fbf380fa377b8c84352337f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763046229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/e688c200b957cca42fbf380fa377b8c84352337f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763046229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As part of UnLoop's dark sense of humour, you can use your laser gun on yourself to end the current time-loop early."},"demos":[{"appid":4031060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UnLoop</strong> is a retro-futuristic VR puzzle game built around self-cooperative time loop mechanics. As a spy infiltrating a remote space station, you encounter a temporal phenomenon that creates copies of yourself each loop, replaying your past actions in real time. Learning to work with your past selves and use the loop to your advantage becomes the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: solve puzzles, retrieve critical data from the station, and uncover the source of the time loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/59f540a770c8a4bc76bd99e41722920a.poster.avif?t=1763046229\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/59f540a770c8a4bc76bd99e41722920a.webm?t=1763046229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"